<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Stanisław Żółkiewski</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates"><a href="/years/1547">1547</a>–<a href="/years/1620">1620</a></span> · <a href="/centuries/16th-century">16th century</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Stanisław Żółkiewski was a Polish military commander and <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/hetman">hetman</a>. In 1610 he defeated a larger Russian force at the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-klushino">Battle of Klushino</a> and occupied <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/moscow">Moscow</a>. Accounts of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/polish-lithuanian-commonwealth">Polish-Lithuanian Commonwealth</a> treat this as the military high point of the Commonwealth.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/stanis-aw-zo-kiewski.jpg" alt="Stanisław Żółkiewski" width="320" height="414" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: AnonymousUnknown author · Public domain · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Stanis%C5%82aw_%C5%BB%C3%B3%C5%82kiewski_11.PNG" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
